<TimeML xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="TimeML_1.2.1.xsd">
  <DOCID>begona</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2014-04-25T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2014-04-25</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT><EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE">KONTSULTARAKO</EVENT> ARRAZOIA&#13;
Ginekologiako larrialdietara <EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE">haurdunaldiaren</EVENT> 20. astean dagoen 29 urteko emakumea <EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE">heldu</EVENT> da.&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DURATION" value="PT2H" temporalFunction="false">Bi orduko iraupeneko</TIMEX3> sabeleko <EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE">min</EVENT> handia dauka. &#13;
Ez du digestio-aparatuko ez gernu-bideko beste <EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE">sintomatologiarik</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE">AURREKARI</EVENT> PERTSONALAK&#13;
6 <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE">haurdunaldi</EVENT>, 5 seme-alaba osasuntsu, ume <EVENT eid="e8" class="STATE">galtze</EVENT> bat. &#13;
Aurrekari <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE">mediko</EVENT> kirurgikorik ez. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE">Alergia</EVENT> ezagunik ez.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e11" class="OCCURRENCE">MIAKETA</EVENT> FISIKOA&#13;
Abdomen bigun eta deprimigarria, eta <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE">mina</EVENT> eskuineko hobi iliakoa <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE">haztatzean</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE">MIAKETA</EVENT> OBSTETRIKOA&#13;
Normala adin gestazionalerako, umetoki lepoa <EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE">itxita</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE">PROBA</EVENT> OSAGARRIAK&#13;
Odol <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE">analisia</EVENT>: 21.200 <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE">leukozito</EVENT>/mikrolito, %85 <EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE">neutrofilo</EVENT>. &#13;
Gernu <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE">analisia</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE">esterasa</EVENT> leukozitarioa 25/mikrolitro.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e22" class="OCCURRENCE">Ekografia</EVENT> obstetrikoa: normala adin gestazionalerako.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE">TRATAMENDUA</EVENT>&#13;
<EVENT eid="e24" class="OCCURRENCE">Parazetamola</EVENT> zain barnetik.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE">Kontsulta</EVENT> artekoa Barne Medikuntzari.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e26" class="OCCURRENCE">Miaketa</EVENT> fisikoa eginda eta <EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE">azterketa</EVENT> osagarriak kontuan izanik, <EVENT eid="e28" class="OCCURRENCE">apendizitis</EVENT> akutua <EVENT eid="e29" class="OCCURRENCE">susmatzen</EVENT> da. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE">Ekografia</EVENT> abdominopelbikoa <EVENT eid="e31" class="OCCURRENCE">eskatu</EVENT> da.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e32" class="OCCURRENCE">Ekografia</EVENT> abdominopelbikoa: ez da abdomen barneko <EVENT eid="e33" class="OCCURRENCE">patologia</EVENT> akuturik <EVENT eid="e34" class="REPORTING">identifikatzen</EVENT>. &#13;
Ez da apendizea <EVENT eid="e35" class="REPORTING">ikusten</EVENT>.&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DURATION" value="PT12H" temporalFunction="false">12 ordu</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e36" class="OCCURRENCE">igaro</EVENT> ondoren, gaixoak <EVENT eid="e37" class="OCCURRENCE">minarekin</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e38" class="ASPECTUAL">jarraitzen</EVENT> duenez, <EVENT eid="e39" class="OCCURRENCE">kontsulta</EVENT> artekoa egin zaio Kirurgiako Zerbitzuari: <TIMEX3 tid="t3" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">Momentu honetan</TIMEX3>, eskuineko hobi iliakoko <EVENT eid="e40" class="OCCURRENCE">minarekin</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e41" class="ASPECTUAL">jarraitzen</EVENT> du, <EVENT eid="e42" class="OCCURRENCE">goragalea</EVENT> du, eta <EVENT eid="e43" class="OCCURRENCE">botaka</EVENT> egin du <TIMEX3 tid="t4" type="SET" value="X" temporalFunction="true">behin</TIMEX3>. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e44" class="OCCURRENCE">Miaketa</EVENT> fisikoan Blumberg <EVENT eid="e45" class="OCCURRENCE">zeinu</EVENT> positiboa. &#13;
Hori eta aipatutako <EVENT eid="e46" class="OCCURRENCE">analisiak</EVENT> kontuan hartuta, <EVENT eid="e47" class="OCCURRENCE">apendizitis</EVENT> akutua <EVENT eid="e48" class="OCCURRENCE">susmatzen</EVENT> da.&#13;
</TEXT>
